modifier.hyxcate.feint.name=Feint
modifier.hyxcate.feint.desc=§oFaster than the speed of light!§r\nYour tool has a 20% chance to deal an additional +25% damage that will pierce through armor.
modifier.hyxcate.frezarites_bane.name=Frezarite's Bane
modifier.hyxcate.frezarites_bane.desc=§oIt's a nuclear winter!§r\nSuccessful hits inflicts Deep Freeze on your target more and more.
modifier.hyxcate.gleaming.name=Gleaming
modifier.hyxcate.gleaming.desc=§oCrystal Power!§r\nYour tool deals +40% damage, less bonus damage is dealt the more lower your health is.
modifier.hyxcate.kreknorites_bane.name=Kreknorite's Bane
modifier.hyxcate.kreknorites_bane.desc=§oHell right at your doorstep!§r\nSuccessful hits inflicts Inferno on your target more and more.
modifier.hyxcate.stunlock.name=Stunlock
modifier.hyxcate.stunlock.desc=§oStay put!§r\nHit targets have a 7.5% chance to become paralyzed and be completely immobile for 5 seconds.
modifier.hyxcate.supercharge.name=Supercharge
modifier.hyxcate.supercharge.desc=§oSupercharge me!§r\nHitting a target or breaking a block has a 10% chance to charge you up with Haste III for 5 seconds!

# Mod Integration - Antique Armory (Construct's Armory)
modifier.hyxcate.astral_plating_armor.name=Astral Plating
modifier.hyxcate.astral_plating_armor.desc=§oCome in, Star Command!§r\nYour armor will completely protect you from 50% of fire and drowning damage.
modifier.hyxcate.frezarites_ward_armor.name=Frezarite's Ward
modifier.hyxcate.frezarites_ward_armor.desc=§oIt's a nuclear winter!§r\nGetting hurt has a chance (10% per armor piece) to inflict Deep Freeze on your attacker more and more.
modifier.hyxcate.gleaming_armor.name=Gleaming
modifier.hyxcate.gleaming_armor.desc=§oCrystal Power!§r\nYour armor will completely protect you from 40% of overall damage taken, this becomes less and less effective the more lower your health is.
modifier.hyxcate.kreknorites_ward_armor.name=Kreknorite's Ward
modifier.hyxcate.kreknorites_ward_armor.desc=§oHell right at your doorstep!§r\nGetting hurt has a chance (10% per armor piece) to inflict Inferno on your attacker more and more.
modifier.hyxcate.star_shield_armor.name=Star Shield
modifier.hyxcate.star_shield_armor.desc=§oOne with the stars!§r\nThere is a chance (5% per armor piece) for damage to be ignored entirely, you'll also gain Resistance III for 5 seconds.
modifier.hyxcate.stunlock_armor.name=Stunlock
modifier.hyxcate.stunlock_armor.desc=§oStay put!§r\nGetting hurt has a chance (2.5% per armor piece) to paralyze your attacker and make them completely immobile for 5 seconds.
modifier.hyxcate.supercharge_armor.name=Supercharge
modifier.hyxcate.supercharge_armor.desc=§oSupercharge me!§r\nGetting hurt has a chance (5% per armor piece) to charge you up with Haste III and Speed III for 5 seconds!

